&lt;h3&gt;Join a French Foodtech Superstar!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we&#39;re shaking up the way people eat in France with our meal kits!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition? To revolutionise our subscribers&#39; everyday lives by promoting a more sustainable way of cooking and introducing them to delicious, creative and balanced recipes. The perfect blend of technology and gastronomy, with plenty of flavour!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh operates in more than 15 countries. France is one of our youngest markets, launched in 2019, where we&#39;ve experienced tremendous growth, establishing ourselves as the market leader. Joining our team means having a real impact within one of France&#39;s most promising scale-ups!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we make all this happen? Through a talented and dynamic team, strong values rooted in kindness and diversity, and an inspiring, stimulating work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;d like to be part of this exciting human, international and entrepreneurial adventure, come and join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role : What’s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The France Marketing &amp;amp; Product Analytics team is a small team at the core of HelloFresh France&#39;s performance management. It measures marketing and product performance, keeps the underlying data reliable, and supports the Growth and Product teams with analyses that guide daily and long-term decisions. ROI and customer lifetime value (CLV) sit at the center of marketing decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team works closely with Marketing, Product, Finance, Operations and Global Analytics (Berlin).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Analyst divides their time equally between Product and Marketing. On the product side, they are the analytical reference for product decisions in France, working with the Culinary, Menu Planning and Strategy &amp;amp; Product Development (SPD) teams. On the marketing side, they shape growth strategy with data, weighing investment allocation and acquisition versus retention trade-offs, and explaining what drives marketing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-cutting responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;: design and maintain internal analytical tools (scripts, dashboards, automations) that support the Culinary, Menu Planning, SPD and marketing workflows, and sponsor agentic analytics and AI tools across both areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do : The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product responsibilities (50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product performance reporting: present regular summaries on menu performance, recipe adoption and assortment rotation to feed management reviews, with key KPIs defined and tracked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer analytics through a product lens: analyze menu and recipe performance together with customer behavior and preferences (satisfaction, repurchase, retention by menu or recipe choice) to inform assortment decisions, and identify high-impact opportunities to feed the product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic projects: lead the analytical and operational side of strategic projects that improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing responsibilities (50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic analyses: collaborate closely with our CMO and marketing leadership to drive strategic decisions (analyses on growth strategy, investment allocation and acquisition versus retention trade-offs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top line performance deep dives: investigate the root causes behind changes in marketing performance, and explain them from a customer and purchase behavior perspective (customer segmentation, discount applied, box taken, purchase behavior over time).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management summaries: turn these deep dives into concise, top-level insights for management review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have graduated from a top-tier engineering or business school, or hold a university degree in Data, Statistics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 4 years of experience in data analytics, business intelligence or data science, ideally in an e-commerce, FMCG or food-tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have advanced SQL skills; Python is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with BI tools (Tableau preferred) and excellent command of Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience using AI/ML tools for exploratory analysis (e.g. anomaly detection), as well as leveraging LLMs to boost analytical productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex analyses into clear, concise and actionable recommendations for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are organised, rigorous and detail-oriented, with the ability to prioritise multiple topics while giving each the attention it deserves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive: you know how to ask the right questions, not just find the answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in French and have a good command of English, both spoken and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: You have a genuine passion for food and an interest in culinary or FMCG-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and international environment, with a strong corporate culture and DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delicious discounts on HelloFresh meal kits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve guaranteed!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive, passionate, proactive, and dynamic French team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central Paris offices (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee benefits (Alan Blue healthcare, transport discount, Gymlib, training budget)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our recruitment process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ll review your CV and cover letter. If your profile looks like a good match, we&#39;ll invite you to a series of interviews and ask you to complete a case study. We&#39;ll do our best to keep the process moving quickly, so we can hopefully welcome you to HelloFresh soon!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your first steps at HelloFresh:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join us, we&#39;ll put together a tailored onboarding programme to help you meet each manager and get to know how HelloFresh works. You&#39;ll also have time to get to know your team before diving into your new role!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEQ327R111&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr. Manager Field Engineering, Digital Natives &amp;amp; Emerging Enterprise France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Solutions Architecture team serves as trusted advisors, helping customers identify and prioritise impactful use cases across their industries. Our team provides expert technical guidance to drive Data and AI solutions from concept to production. They act as a bridge between customers, product teams, and sales, ensuring that solutions are not only technically sound but also aligned with business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a senior technical and strategic role focused on designing, developing, and implementing technology solutions tailored for digital native companies—businesses born in the digital era, often leveraging cloud, APIs, and modern data platforms. This leader not only understands data solutions but also focuses on growing and developing a team of Solution Architects who drive the adoption of the Databricks Platform at the largest, fastest-growing tech companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through competitive landscapes, best practices, and implementation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership to help customers understand how Databricks can solve their business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, build, and mentor a high-performing team of solution architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive exceptional customer outcomes demonstrated by production applications and increased adoption of APIs and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop technical champions within customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Engagement &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with sales teams to develop account strategies and align on plans that help our customers to achieve their business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical win strategies and support technical account management for strategic customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with end-user and developer communities to understand needs and tailor solutions accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience (often 5+ years) in infrastructure architecture, database architecture, networking, and IT development or consulting within software or internet industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital native business models and their technology and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complex technical environments and communicate effectively with both technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be successful in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in the data space with a technical product (i.e. data warehousing, big data, cloud infrastructure, or machine learning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of experience building and leading technical customer-facing teams: hiring, onboarding, and supporting team members in a high growth environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong communication skills with excellent presentation and negotiation skills, both in-person and written.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in pre-sales activities, such as solution design and business value selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring a team vision about the unique nature of the digital natives business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of execution by managing workloads and consumption with sales, product, and engineering counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning C-level alignment in accounts to guide strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Location for this role is Paris, France&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
